    {
      "id": "HRE01",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: module result history, current-result selection and help",
      "from": "ModuleResultView.hstTab / m_DataGrid",
      "to": "LogInfo历史文本列表，不是撤销栈或已证帧回放",
      "behavior": "原ModuleResultView BAML解码与本地XAML字节相等；hstTab中m_DataGrid以OneWay/IsAsync绑定当前装饰器ModuleDisplayInfoList，列为RowIndex/AddTime/Content，菜单Clear/Save。LogInfo原字段仅ulong RowIndex及Content/AddTime字符串、属性通知，不包含图像/模块快照。所选m_DataGrid声明没有SelectionChanged，而m_ResultDataGrid是另一当前结果控件；这不是全程序历史行选择监听不存在的证明。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ModuleResultView.xaml",
