      "behavior": "InfoTab_SelectionChanged仅!isDecoratorRebuilding且SelectedItem==CurResultTabItem时RefreshDataListResult(datalist,true)；所选体没有历史/帮助选择重放操作。SetFirstVisibleTab找首个可见Tab，写SelectedIndex及当前curTabIndex。IsInfoTabExpand变化通知后将resultRow高度设235或40。Help TextBlock通过Lang.ResourceBinding读取m_CurrentInfo.HelperContent；非流程且缓存null时生成ModuleTypeName+_HELP，替换/trim后缓存，并非该getter直接读取说明文件。",
