      "id": "HRE04",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: module result history, current-result selection and help",
      "from": "RefreshRecordResult / AnalyzeResultList",
      "to": "SDK分批查询→当年结果文本入队与有限释放",
      "behavior": "RefreshRecordResult先清ModuleDisplayInfoList，再ignoreTimer=true；VMModule为空/首查询无值即返回，finally仍尝试释放非零buffer并复位ignore=false。先Query(ID,0,1)，Analyze推进index/totalNum，后续在累计记录数<500且totalNum>index时按剩余容量与首批记录数估请求量。Analyze暂存tempInfoList并换新，逆序遍历native结果PreProData(isFilter:true)，仅dtEndTime.Year==当前年才AddRecord，最后把原pending记录加回。catch分VmException/Exception日志；finally释放若抛错会跳过其后的ignore=false，未保证异常时pending恢复或所有释放成功。",
      "refs": [
