          "excerpt": "          \"token\": \"0x06000946\",\n          \"symbol\": {\n            \"token\": \"0x06000946\",\n            \"kind\": \"method-def\",\n            \"type\": \"VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.ModuleDisplayDecorator\",\n            \"name\": \"AnalyzeResultList\",\n            \"parameters\": 4,\n            \"attributes\": \"Private, HideBySig\",\n            \"signatureBytes\": \"20040815118141011185fd0210081008\"\n          },\n          \"status\": \"decoded\",\n          \"issue\": null,\n          \"ilSize\": 321,\n          \"ilSha256\": \"c8ceb350b81d375b4303efc0fb8806f0fa45c8dc60b454e9d4c62266a872fe74\",\n          \"ilBytes\": \"\",\n          \"instructions\": [\n            {\n              \"offset\": 0,\n              \"label\": \"IL_0000\",\n              \"opcode\": \"nop\",",
          "evidenceType": "original-managed-cil",
          "binaryIdentity": "99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d"
        },
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/ModuleDisplayDecorator.cs",
          "member": "History query, catches and finally",
          "sha256": "ceda24b7fb93bcd9f02b77b23d42a839b1f737bf70cf3abc6b7786d11765740e",
          "start": 856,
          "end": 915,
          "excerpt": "\tinternal void RefreshRecordResult()\n\t{\n\t\tIntPtr pstModuleResBuff = IntPtr.Zero;\n\t\ttry\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tModuleDisplayInfoList.Clear();\n\t\t\tignoreRefreshRecordTimerTick = true;\n\t\t\tif (VMModule == null)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tint index = 0;\n\t\t\tint totalNum = 0;\n\t\t\tImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_QUERY_MODULE_RES_INFO_LIST? resultList = ServerSDKManager.serverSDKManager.mModuleManager.QueryModuleHistoryResult(VMModule.ID, 0, 1u, ref pstModuleResBuff);\n\t\t\tif (!resultList.HasValue)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tint num = AnalyzeResultList(resultList, isChangeErrorInfo: true, ref index, ref totalNum);\n\t\t\tint num2 = num;\n\t\t\tif (IntPtr.Zero != pstModuleResBuff)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tServerSDKManager.serverSDKManager.mModuleManager.ReleaseModuleHistoryResult(ref pstModuleResBuff);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\twhile (num2 < 500 && totalNum > index)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tuint num3 = Math.Max(1u, (uint)Math.Ceiling((double)(500 - num2) / (double)num));\n\t\t\t\tif (index + num3 > totalNum)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tnum3 = (uint)(totalNum - index);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tresultList = ServerSDKManager.serverSDKManager.mModuleManager.QueryModuleHistoryResult(VMModule.ID, index, num3, ref pstModuleResBuff);\n\t\t\t\tif (!resultList.HasValue)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tbreak;\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tnum2 += AnalyzeResultList(resultList, isChangeErrorInfo: false, ref index, ref totalNum);\n\t\t\t\tif (IntPtr.Zero != pstModuleResBuff)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tServerSDKManager.serverSDKManager.mModuleManager.ReleaseModuleHistoryResult(ref pstModuleResBuff);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tcatch (VmException ex)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tLogHelper.Error($\"ErrorCode:{ex.errorCode}, ErrorMessage:{ex.errorMessage}\");\n\t\t}\n\t\tcatch (Exception ex2)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tLogHelper.Error(ex2.Message + \", \" + ex2.StackTrace);\n\t\t}\n\t\tfinally\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tif (IntPtr.Zero != pstModuleResBuff)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tServerSDKManager.serverSDKManager.mModuleManager.ReleaseModuleHistoryResult(ref pstModuleResBuff);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tignoreRefreshRecordTimerTick = false;\n\t\t}\n\t}",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        },
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/ModuleDisplayDecorator.cs",
          "member": "Query result order and pending queue preservation",
          "sha256": "ceda24b7fb93bcd9f02b77b23d42a839b1f737bf70cf3abc6b7786d11765740e",
          "start": 917,
          "end": 949,
          "excerpt": "\tprivate int AnalyzeResultList(ImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_QUERY_MODULE_RES_INFO_LIST? resultList, bool isChangeErrorInfo, ref int index, ref int totalNum)\n\t{\n\t\tint num = 0;\n\t\tif (resultList.HasValue)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tList<LogInfo> list = null;\n\t\t\tlock (_recordlock)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tlist = tempInfoList;\n\t\t\t\ttempInfoList = new List<LogInfo>();\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tindex += resultList.Value.nNum;\n\t\t\ttotalNum = resultList.Value.nTotalNum;\n\t\t\tImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_MODULE_RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX[] array = resultList.Value.pastModuResultList();\n\t\t\tfor (int num2 = resultList.Value.nNum - 1; num2 >= 0; num2--)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_MODULE_RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX_Data iMVS_MODULE_RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX_Data = ServerSDKManager.serverSDKManager.mModuleManager.PreProData(array[num2], isFilter: true);\n\t\t\t\tif (iMVS_MODULE_RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX_Data.dtEndTime.Year == DateTime.Now.Year)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tnum += AddRecord(iMVS_MODULE_RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX_Data, isChangeErrorInfo);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tif (list != null)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tlock (_recordlock)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\ttempInfoList.AddRange(list);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn num;\n\t}\n",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": [
        "num==0请求量计算、native total/index单位、跨年数据、异常中间状态和最大显示条数时序未知；累计数是生成LogInfo数，非必然等于native执行次数。"
      ],
      "operationComplete": false
    },
