    {
      "id": "HRE06",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: module result history, current-result selection and help",
      "from": "RefreshDataRecord / AddRecord / GetRecordContent",
      "to": "文本记录来源、批次去重与ErrorInfo差异",
      "behavior": "回调尾部RefreshDataRecord仅当前m_CurrentInfo非null时AddRecord(result,true,true)，异常日志。AddRecord只识别SDK结果结构；callback先写curCallBackExecuteCount，非self且<=maxQuery即跳过；query更新maxQuery后若<=curCallBack也跳过。DataRecord.GetRecordContent在状态非1/5时返错误字符串；同执行次数可读缓存DataRecord.Content数组，否则按Content.MappingArray从result.pInfo取对应值格式化。数组逐项非空才入tempInfoList，num>=500只break该数组循环；标量即使空也入一条后break dataRecords循环。返回num是加入记录数；isChangeErrorInfo时ErrorInfo=text，数组分支可能仍为null，不应按注释称返回执行失败布尔值。",
