      "from": "当前Attach / ReplaceExecutionScope / OnClosed",
      "to": "物理解订阅与已排队委托的二次门",
      "behavior": "DetachExecutionScope从subscribedExecutionScope移除两个保留delegate实例并置空字段。Attach先Detach，再捕获owner，安装ProcedureRefreshRequested/ProcedureRunRequested处理器；两者排Dispatcher.BeginInvoke后在实际执行时再次比较scope引用和ScopeId。refresh另要求当前流程相同；run另拒windowClosed/activeRun，并查请求流程确含NodeId才RunProcedure。Replace先Invalidate再Detach，清计数/调试/配置/结果，Dispose旧scope、新建并Attach。OnClosed先Close epoch/Detach/doc.Dispose，再置windowClosed，关callback queue/配置/scope等；源码不是try/finally，任一步抛错不保证余下清理完成。取消旧run与解事件也不等于撤销Dispatcher已排队项，因此委托内owner门独立保留。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs",
          "member": "Current physical detach and queued delegate admission",
          "sha256": "bb92b32267ff332b4e0955ef3dc600a8bc7b2f7b38a8804128c146dae439a52a",
          "start": 17,
          "end": 32,
          "excerpt": " void DetachExecutionScope(){\n  if(subscribedExecutionScope is {} old){if(scopeRefreshHandler is not null)old.ProcedureRefreshRequested-=scopeRefreshHandler;if(scopeRunHandler is not null)old.ProcedureRunRequested-=scopeRunHandler;}\n  subscribedExecutionScope=null;scopeRefreshHandler=null;scopeRunHandler=null;\n }\n void AttachExecutionScope(){\n  doc.PrepareLoad=plugins.PrepareLoad;\n  doc.PreparePasteSubscriptions=PrepareToolPasteSubscriptions;\n  doc.PrepareExecutionTopologyChange=PrepareToolExecutionTopologyChange;\n  DetachExecutionScope();\n  if(!AppContext.TryGetSwitch(\"VisionEditor.DisableAutomaticCameraDiscovery\",out bool disabled)||!disabled)\n   RefreshCameraProvider(false);\n  var owner=executionScope;\n  scopeRefreshHandler=request=>Dispatcher.BeginInvoke(()=>{if(!windowClosed&&ReferenceEquals(executionScope,owner)&&request.ScopeId==owner.Id&&request.ProcedureId==doc.CurrentProcedureId)RefreshRight();});\n  scopeRunHandler=request=>Dispatcher.BeginInvoke(()=>{if(windowClosed||activeRun is not null||!ReferenceEquals(executionScope,owner)||request.ScopeId!=owner.Id)return;var procedure=doc.Document.Procedures.FirstOrDefault(p=>p.Id==request.ProcedureId&&p.Nodes.Any(n=>n.Id==request.NodeId));if(procedure is not null)_=RunProcedure(procedure.Id);});\n  subscribedExecutionScope=owner;owner.ProcedureRefreshRequested+=scopeRefreshHandler;owner.ProcedureRunRequested+=scopeRunHandler;\n }",
          "evidenceType": "current-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs",
          "member": "Current replace scope ordering",
          "sha256": "bb92b32267ff332b4e0955ef3dc600a8bc7b2f7b38a8804128c146dae439a52a",
          "start": 44,
          "end": 45,
          "excerpt": " void ReplaceExecutionScope(){executionOwnerEpoch.Invalidate();DetachExecutionScope();activeConfigurationRuns=0;configurationRunsByProcedure.Clear();debugSolution=null;toolDebugRecords.Clear();toolDebugInvalid.Clear();CloseToolConfiguration();activeRun?.Cancel();configurationResults.Clear();pointAliasPresentation.Clear();workflowSessions.Clear();results.Clear();executionScope.Dispose();executionScope=new();AttachExecutionScope();}\n void RetainExecutionNodes(){var nodes=doc.Document.Procedures.SelectMany(p=>p.Nodes.Select(n=>(p.Id,n.ModuleId,n.Id))).ToHashSet();executionScope.RetainProcedureNodes(nodes);foreach(var key in pointAliasPresentation.Keys.Where(k=>!nodes.Contains(k)).ToArray())pointAliasPresentation.Remove(key);}",
          "evidenceType": "current-source",
